{
  "schema": 1,
  "module": "node:net",
  "version": "26.13.0",
  "sourceCommit": "18b32a3b1552e199a01f1a8d9fd64aa756d3b75b",
  "document": {
    "path": "doc/api/net.md",
    "sha256": "936b2c80963b118b4c7359c1730b36d5a552019d2d534515b3c4630912d4bba8"
  },
  "surfaceReview": "Seven selected API headings reviewed for socket inactivity timers and construction. This is not a full net audit; export presence and selected file passes do not prove complete behavior.",
  "fullCompatibility": false,
  "controls": {
    "path": "host/test/fixtures/node-socket-timeouts.ts",
    "sha256": "cd122302ad017895819df29e483009f310411896a6c3c1a140ba3dbd1f5f8740",
    "sourceTest": "host/test/node-socket-timeouts.test.ts",
    "nodeProductTest": "host/test/node-core-compat.test.ts",
    "browserProductTest": "apps/browser-demos/test/node-socket-timeouts.spec.ts",
    "allHostRunner": "scripts/run-nodejs-socket-timeout-tests.ts",
    "writeProgressControl": "host/test/fixtures/node-socket-write-progress.ts",
    "independentPeer": "host/test/fixtures/node-socket-write-peer.c"
  },
  "upstreamSelection": "tests/nodejs/selections/socket-timeouts.json",
  "rows": [
    {
      "api": "socket.setTimeout(timeout[, callback])",
      "status": "partial",
      "review": "Real unreferenced inactivity deadlines, notification without auto-close, callback registration/cancellation, validation and activity refresh. TLS/parent integration, full listener and reconnect matrices remain unreviewed."
    },
    {
      "api": "net.Socket timeout event",
      "status": "partial",
      "review": "Notifications exercised for connected and unconnected sockets; complete event ordering, listener mutation and unusual lifecycle combinations remain unreviewed."
    },
    {
      "api": "socket.timeout",
      "status": "partial",
      "review": "Undefined initially and raw value assigned before validation, matching the pinned implementation; descriptor and full mutation matrices remain unreviewed."
    },
    {
      "api": "new net.Socket([options])",
      "status": "partial",
      "review": "Bare call, construction and modern subclasses; actual descriptor metadata and selected fd validation. Legacy constructor.call inheritance, full fd kind validation, options and signal matrices remain incomplete."
    },
    {
      "api": "new net.Server([options][, connectionListener])",
      "status": "partial",
      "review": "Bare call, construction and modern subclasses exercised through real listeners; full inheritance, options, descriptor and lifecycle matrices remain incomplete."
    },
    {
      "api": "net.createConnection(options[, connectListener])",
      "status": "partial",
      "review": "Passes options into Socket and applies connection timeout; full option/overload/validation matrices remain incomplete."
    },
    {
      "api": "net.connect()",
      "status": "partial",
      "review": "Shares identity with createConnection; alias descriptors and complete overload behavior remain unreviewed."
    }
  ],
  "remainingReview": [
    "DNS/Resolver, accurate IPv6/interface metadata, socket controls, paused reads, backpressure and stream behavior remain incomplete.",
    "EventEmitter.removeListener currently removes all equal callbacks rather than one; duplicate timeout-listener cancellation is therefore incomplete.",
    "Socket legacy constructor.call inheritance, reconnect state and option/signal/error/descriptor matrices remain incomplete.",
    "Handle metadata reports the actual owned descriptor and native pending-write bytes. It does not implement the V8/libuv private handle API.",
    "The complete net public surface, including newer Node 26 APIs, has not been audited.",
    "The original broader WebKit core/PATH spawn ENOMEM observation remains unresolved. Selected passing runs do not establish its cause or a fix.",
    "Full product, broad POSIX, application-switching memory and performance gates remain deferred."
  ],
